## Verification Queries

```sql
SELECT sequencename, increment_by, last_value
FROM pg_sequences
WHERE schemaname = 'public'
  AND sequencename IN ('sequence_generator', 'batch_job_seq', 'batch_job_execution_seq', 'batch_step_execution_seq');

SELECT MAX(id) FROM event_details;
SELECT MAX(id) FROM event_type_details;
SELECT MAX(id) FROM event_media;
```

After sync, `sequence_generator.last_value` should be ≥ global max `id` across tables in the GREATEST list (or dynamic discovery in batch-jobs service).

