## Checklist (new environment)

- [ ] Schema applied from `Latest_Schema_Post__Blob_Claude_12.sql` (`INCREMENT BY 1`)
- [ ] INSERT file imported (ordered or renumbered)
- [ ] `sync_sequence_after_inserts.sql` executed on **this** database
- [ ] `sync_spring_batch_sequences.sql` executed if batch tables have rows
- [ ] Backend deployed with `allocationSize = 1` on all `sequence_generator` entities
- [ ] Legacy DB: one-time `fix_sequence_generator_increment_by_one.sql` if `increment_by = 50`
- [ ] Verify `last_value` and create one test row via app
